  "version": 1,
  "doc": "Reedhollow's Kirru (the Lead, 2026-10-30: the creatures track builds the Kirru crowd bodies, assets_src/crowd/kirru; characters keep the named Pell, Owa and the Kirru child). The clutch: eight bodies on the greybox's clutch_0..7 stage actors on the Shore, so the farewell-tide (B09) shows Kirru, not capsules (the stage actors stay hidden until the story shows them); the bodies alternate so no two neighbours in either line match. The watchers (R01: the Kirru are already watching from the platforms, very tall, very still): one on each house platform, facing the lagoon, each row's `at` making its stand-in at CrowdSpots/<id>. Pell is never inside (rule 3); the gate and the causeway are clear. `body` rows: Kirru wear no tints. Each row's `tuning`: the Kirru's eye height (2.05 m, the youngster's 1.45 m) so their look-ats meet the party's eyes, and their stillness (bible section 8; pell.md section 1): a slower look-about, a longer and rarer glance, a narrow idle pace.",
